# Generated reports
backend/reports/

# Runtime telemetry drop-boxes (session ledgers + auto-flushed DI run logs, user call 2026-07-27)
# Evidence ships curated under qa/ — raw runtime logs never enter the repo.
backend/logs/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-bench/journeys/runs/

# lesson-bench packages: 60-100KB hydrated lesson dumps, regenerated per /lesson-coverage
# run. 20 pre-existing ones are already committed (left as history, not rewritten) but
# new packages accumulate too fast to review/commit individually going forward.
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-bench/packages/

# lesson-planner A/B harnesses (scripts/lesson-planner-*.mjs, *-topic-ab.mjs, native-mode-ab.mjs)
# each write raw per-lesson output to their own scratch directory. The scripts themselves
# now nest every raw stage (records/packages/blind-review/capabilities/...) under one
# .raw/ segment inside their --out dir, so this single rule is the durable fix — a future
# script reusing that convention needs no new line here, unlike the name-specific rules
# below (kept as defense-in-depth for scripts predating the .raw/ convention).
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/**/.raw/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/**/records/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/**/packages/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/**/blind-review/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/**/lexical/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/**/semantic/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/**/discovery-cache/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/**/capabilities/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/**/runs/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/**/*sweep*/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/mode-card-ab/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/open-topic/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/staged-ab/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/staged-full-catalog/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-planner/literacy-exemplars/